WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:02.080
- Your son has a famous godfather.

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:04.810
And I found this amazing, I
didn't know this connection.

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:05.750
So who, who's your guy?

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.107
Can you tell everybody, who the godfather?

00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:08.457
- Oh, I can tell everybody.

00:00:09.507 --> 00:00:13.510
Yeah, he's somebody that
I admire and respect,

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:17.860
not only as an amazing
father, an amazing husband,

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:21.140
amazing musician, and an amazing actor.

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:23.220
His name's Tim McGraw.

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:24.150
- [Kelly] That's so crazy cool.

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:24.983
- Yeah.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:25.903
- It was look, we,

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:28.366
I've known him for a long time.

00:00:28.366 --> 00:00:30.840
We laugh about it because it's been

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:32.750
probably over 17 years now

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:34.550
that we did "Friday
Night Lights" together,

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:36.080
we played father and son.

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:37.880
So I got to first experience him,

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:39.890
you know, as a father in that film,

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:42.610
a little more of somewhat an abusive one.

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:46.120
But then we did "Country Strong" together.

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:51.100
And we've remained such
close friends, and the

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:52.540
you know, I've seen his

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:55.630
children and his daughters

00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:58.400
from the time they were
one, three and five, now.

00:00:58.400 --> 00:00:59.393
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- You know.

00:00:59.393 --> 00:01:01.730
- It's kinda cool for him
because he doesn't have a boy.

00:01:01.730 --> 00:01:03.520
So to get to play a father.
- Of course, and that's the

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.980
yeah, and so, you know?

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:07.950
- He's got a lot of estrogen
rocking that household.

00:01:07.950 --> 00:01:11.850
- He does, he feels sometimes singled out.

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:13.980
- Yeah, I would to.
- But,

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:15.030
no, he's the best.

00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:17.140
And, when I said that,

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:19.120
you know, after around the 12 weeks,

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:22.260
you know, kind of time
of Emma being pregnant.

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:24.010
- Yeah.
- I called him.

00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:26.950
And the first thing he said
was, "I'm the godfather."

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:28.223
So.
- [Kelly] That's so cool.

00:01:28.223 --> 00:01:29.630
- How can you argue?

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:32.480
- Yeah, it's a beautiful thing
to ask of someone too, so.

